    "body": "closes #40709\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\n\r\nNested `runtime! ftplugin/lmaoxd.vim` inheritance still skips corresponding Lua ftplugins.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nConver bang-runtime nested inheritance calls in bundled ftplugins to `{vim,lua}` patterns.\r\n\r\nChanges \"only\" (still ~59, lol) ftplugins with `runtime!` inheritance.",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-13T22:18:51Z",
